TITLE Pure water pH 7 @150C equilibrated with chrysotile and talc
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc       0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file q.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Mg_molal Si_molal
    10 PUNCH TOT("Mg"), TOT("Si")
END
